---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Privacy Policy for Arkansas Property Buyers LLC — how we collect, use, and protect the information you share with us."
>

<!-- HEADER -->
<Header />

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="bg-navy pt-16 pb-14 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase leading-tight text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="font-body text-white/70 text-sm">Last updated: July 15, 2026</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTENT -->
<section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">

      <div>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Arkansas Property Buyers LLC ("Arkansas Property Buyers," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect through arkansaspropertybuyers.com (the "Site"), how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">When you submit a form on our Site, we may collect:</p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 mb-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Your name, phone number, and email address</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Property information, such as the address, city, and zip code of a property you're asking about</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Any additional details you choose to share with us, such as a message describing your situation</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Your consent choices regarding text messages, described below</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">If you use our website chat widget, the third-party provider of that widget (GoHighLevel/LeadConnector) may also collect the information you enter into it. Our site loads fonts from Google Fonts, which may process your IP address as part of delivering those fonts. We do not currently use analytics, advertising, or tracking cookies on this Site.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">We use the information you provide to:</p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Respond to your inquiry and evaluate your property</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Contact you by phone, text message, or email regarding your inquiry, requested information, and appointment scheduling</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">If you've opted in, send occasional promotional or educational messages about property-selling options and homeowner resources</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Maintain records of our communications with you</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">How We Share Your Information</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">We use GoHighLevel as our customer relationship management (CRM) and communications platform. When you submit a form, your information is sent to GoHighLevel so our team can follow up with you. We do not sell your information.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed font-bold text-navy">No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties, excluding service providers that support the delivery of our messaging services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Text Message (SMS) Communications</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">If you check either or both of the consent checkboxes on a form, you agree that Arkansas Property Buyers LLC may send you text messages related to your property inquiry, requested information, appointment scheduling, and/or occasional promotional and educational content about property-selling options and homeowner resources. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Consent to receive text messages is never required to use our services or to receive a cash offer on your property.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">You may opt out of text messages at any time by replying <span class="font-bold text-navy">STOP</span> to any message. For help, reply <span class="font-bold text-navy">HELP</span>, or call us directly at <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">(501) 504-7109</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Data Security</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We take reasonable measures to protect the information you share with us. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Our Site is intended for adults and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Your Choices</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the information you've shared with us by calling <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">(501) 504-7109</a> or by submitting a request through our <a href="/contact/" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">Contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Arkansas Property Buyers LLC<br>2024 Arkansas Valley Dr., Ste 407<br>Little Rock, Arkansas 72212<br><a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">(501) 504-7109</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer />

</Layout>
